# Optional: Upstox login for 2-second futures OI. Without these, OrderUnlock
# still shows OI from Upstox's public candle API (refreshed every few minutes).
# Create an app at https://account.upstox.com/developer/apps with the redirect URL below.
UPSTOX_API_KEY=
UPSTOX_API_SECRET=
UPSTOX_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:4173/auth/upstox/callback
